{{Passive skill box|Strength of Blood}}
'''Strength of Blood''' is a [[keystone passive skill]] which disables [[recovery]] from non-instant [[Life Leech]], while granting 2% additional [[physical]] [[damage reduction]] for every 3% recovery per second from [[life leech]].

==Location==
This keystone will conquer any keystones within the radius of a {{il|Lethal Pride}} jewel with modifier {{c|mod|Commanded leadership over (10000–18000) warriors under '''Kaom'''}}.

==Mechanics==
The physical damage reduction only applies while leeching, and is based on the life recovery of your current leech instances.<ref name=mechanics/> Without modifiers, per-second life recovery from leech is capped at 20%, allowing Strength of Blood to grant up to 12% additional physical damage reduction.  

Preventing the removal of life leech (when unreserved life is filled) is typically required to reliably gain physical damage reduction. This can be accomplished through: 
* {{psl|Brutal Fervour}}, {{psl|q_where=passive_skills.name="Slayer" AND ascendancy_class="Ascendant"}} and {{il|Offering to the Serpent}} 
* {{psl|Immortal Ambition}}, provided the user is not on [[full life]] (as leech would recover energy shield instead) 
* {{sl|Petrified Blood}}, provided the user has some unreserved life above their [[low life]] threshold 

